@startuml
title Dark/Light Mode Toggle Flow

actor User
participant "ThemeToggle\n(button)" as Toggle
participant "useTheme\n(React hook)" as Hook
participant "localStorage" as LS
participant "document.documentElement\n(<html> class)" as DOM
participant "UI Components\n(e.g., LandingPage)" as UI

== Initial load ==
User -> UI: open page
UI -> Hook: useTheme() mount
Hook -> LS: getItem("theme")
LS --> Hook: savedTheme?
Hook -> DOM: detect prefers-color-scheme (dark/light)
Hook -> Hook: set theme = savedTheme or systemTheme
Hook -> DOM: applyTheme(theme)\n(add/remove .dark class)
Hook -> LS: setItem("theme", theme)

== Toggle theme ==
User -> Toggle: click "Dark/Light Mode"
Toggle -> Hook: toggleTheme()
Hook -> Hook: newTheme = light?dark:light
Hook -> DOM: applyTheme(newTheme)\n(add/remove .dark class)
Hook -> LS: setItem("theme", newTheme)
Hook -> UI: state update (theme)
UI -> UI: re-render with new colors\n(dark <-> light)

== Persisted revisit ==
User -> UI: revisit site
UI -> Hook: useTheme() mount
Hook -> LS: getItem("theme")
LS --> Hook: savedTheme (if exists)
Hook -> DOM: applyTheme(savedTheme)
UI -> UI: render with saved theme

@enduml

